OL,3,GNEWSAArrest as police investigate
OL,4,Aservices break-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating a break-in at a
OL,7,Fservice station have arrested a man.
OL,9,FCambridgeshire Police said it was
OL,10,Fcalled to the services in Station Road,
OL,11,FMarch, at 03:15 BST on Thursday. The
OL,12,Fsite was cordoned off by officers.
OL,14,FThe force said a 47-year-old man, from
OL,15,Fthe Fenland town, was arrested on
OL,16,Fsuspicion of burglary and possession of
OL,17,Fa knife.
OL,19,FIt added that the individual remained
OL,20,Fin custody.
